Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.13,0:00:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)绝对不可能的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.87,0:00:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)才没那回事！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次 我一定！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.07,0:00:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(有贺)九十九游马同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.43,0:00:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 你是？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(有贺)初次见面。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是… 爱与冒险的漫画研究部部长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.33,0:00:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有贺千太郎。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.73,0:00:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)漫研？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)就是那个只有1个部员的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其实 我有事想拜托你。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:29.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们漫研将倾尽全力创作的一大巨篇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个主角的原型就拜托游马同学 你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我当成漫画的原型？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.81,0:00:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)好厉害啊 游马同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.50,0:00:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.31,0:00:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗狂欢节的霸者！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.26,0:00:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}男人中的男人！ 九十九游马同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.10,0:00:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除了你以外 没有别的模特了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！ 这就是 我！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.37,0:00:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.18,0:00:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说 游马君你的弱点是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的弱点…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.86,0:00:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.05,0:00:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完全没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.39,0:00:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那真是可靠。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.76,0:01:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.02,0:01:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙君！ 神代凌牙君！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.02,0:01:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}务必 也希望你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.85,0:01:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能来当模特。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.02,0:01:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看 你就是模特的角色。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是精心设计的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.39,0:01:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)切！ 真没品味。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.63,0:01:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.77,0:01:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.08,0:01:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.46,0:01:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别碰我！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.90,0:01:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.81,0:01:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，谢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.27,0:01:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个速写本里，装着比命还重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.66,0:01:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}漫画的点子和草图{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.12,0:01:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都记在里面了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.61,0:01:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，那漫画我就期待着了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.03,0:01:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，鲨鱼！你给我等等。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.95,0:02:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还是一样嘴臭啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说事实有什么不对。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.23,0:02:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪，你到底什么时候才能醒过来……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.39,0:02:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.11,0:02:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((璃绪：好的，凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.62,0:02:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁要跟你戴什么情侣戒指啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.30,0:02:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底，男人戴什么戒指……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)什么啊，你这话说的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.32,0:02:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就算了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙你这个笨蛋！))
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)什么!? 要攻击神代凌牙？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.11,0:03:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的。九十九游马的弱点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.48,0:03:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然没能找到{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.69,0:03:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但凌牙的弱点我已经探到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.38,0:03:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有的计划都在这本素描本里。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.39,0:03:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧 你试试看。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.87,0:03:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.27,0:03:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切 都是为了异晶界。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.53,0:03:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也试着画了漫画哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.47,0:03:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}画得不错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)探病带这么多东西够了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)鲨鱼的妹妹{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直处于沉睡状态
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.82,0:05:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不是说过了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎!? 那…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}点心和水果都吃不了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事 我全给吃了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.91,0:05:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！ 我们 你妹妹的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.53,0:05:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪她…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪从病房里消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.39,0:05:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失了!? 消失了 去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(有贺)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀哎呀 各位 都到齐了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.29,0:05:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 是漫研部的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.84,0:05:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}莫非{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是在找妹妹吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.82,0:05:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 你会知道璃绪的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.21,0:05:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 是你这家伙干的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵告诉你们她的下落也可以{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.21,0:05:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但有条件。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.06,0:05:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我 决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.31,0:05:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.26,0:05:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了，你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.90,0:05:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）游马，小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.95,0:06:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从他身上感觉到一股异样的气息。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.62,0:06:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，你打算怎么办？凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.39,0:06:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思这场决斗，我接下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.23,0:06:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[扬声器]AR影像，链接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.39,0:06:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.15,0:06:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不会原谅你！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.33,0:06:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.90,0:06:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤鲨鱼帕斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再将存在于自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水属性怪兽解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.51,0:06:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤鲨鱼枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.63,0:06:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.44,0:06:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.89,0:06:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.29,0:06:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动漫画·场地！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.80,0:06:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个场地 就是我的漫画世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.95,0:07:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切 都由我创作的剧情来决定。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.22,0:07:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说我创造出的英雄才是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.15,0:07:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爱与诚与勇气的英雄。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.19,0:07:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}治愈·鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.84,0:07:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜负正朝着 你这家伙败北的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.94,0:07:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结局突飞猛进！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.67,0:07:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 湖之骑士 兰斯洛特！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动 魔法卡 剑之誓约！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.51,0:07:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.67,0:07:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战士族怪兽1只的场合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.11,0:07:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.42,0:07:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只4星战士族怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.21,0:07:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 悲恋之骑士 特里斯坦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}4星怪兽有2只！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.92,0:07:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将4星的兰斯洛特和特里斯坦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:07:58.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.34,0:07:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.37,0:08:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.43,0:08:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 漫画英雄 国王亚瑟！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.47,0:08:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兰斯洛特的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.77,0:08:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.44,0:08:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为超量单位时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.86,0:08:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方1只怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.18,0:08:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降800点。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.66,0:08:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 国王亚瑟。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.49,0:08:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击鲨鱼枪兵。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.01,0:08:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太天真了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖的卡是 宙斯祝福。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效对方怪兽的攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.89,0:08:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 还会给你造成伤害的陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.40,0:08:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 宙斯祝福 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你确定要攻击我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.17,0:08:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙 我来告诉你吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.45,0:08:48.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的妹妹现在怎么样了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.71,0:08:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的妹妹就在我创造出的空想世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.35,0:08:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是，漫画的世界里。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃、璃绪？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么可能……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果打倒我的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.97,0:09:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我创造出的空想世界也会崩塌。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.55,0:09:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到那时候你的妹妹会怎么样。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.02,0:09:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪有这样的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太卑鄙了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.23,0:09:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代凌牙，你是赢不了的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.79,0:09:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，让我把 No.卡收回来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.70,0:09:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}国王骑士，继续攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪光剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.01,0:09:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去，鲨鱼就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然，那家伙是巴利安的刺客。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.31,0:09:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到此为止了，神代凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.27,0:10:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论如何都得把璃绪救出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.03,0:10:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，这个场地是他创造出的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以说，就是他的创作品。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}创作品？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.96,0:10:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，那个人的素描本。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个人创造出的世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.71,0:10:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该全都画在那里面了那样的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.93,0:10:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此那本素描本里有线索！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.07,0:10:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我，鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.77,0:10:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的妹妹{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.84,0:10:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会救出来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.73,0:10:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.74,0:10:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤锤头鲨。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.45,0:10:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行，那种怪兽可不行。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.10,0:10:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把 No.怪兽叫出来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.48,0:10:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没办法，我来帮你一把吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡发动，英雄的受难！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:10:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上有漫画英雄存在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方召唤怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.33,0:11:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将与召唤的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.56,0:11:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同等级的怪兽2只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.72,0:11:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组中挑选特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.46,0:11:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，召唤吧，凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.81,0:11:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将尖刺鲨和双头鲨\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.91,0:11:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，呼唤吧，No.怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用锤头鲨、尖刺鲨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.35,0:11:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双头鲨叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.22,0:11:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.95,0:11:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.60,0:11:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.32
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.13,0:11:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海咬龙 鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.76,0:11:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 接下来怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.65,0:11:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反正 我没办法攻击对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.10,0:11:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}尽管放马攻过来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的攻击也 全部
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都被我编进故事里了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.54,0:12:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强敌人的出现让英雄陷入绝境的真正英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《你在盘算什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但 现在 只能听那家伙的了》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.27,0:12:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！ 上吧 海咬龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.28,0:12:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击国王亚瑟！ 深咬！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.97,0:12:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会… 国王亚瑟竟然被打倒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.34,0:12:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}国王亚瑟！ 世界的和平与
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.62,0:12:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家的希望都寄托在你身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站起来 国王亚瑟！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.17,0:12:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.60,0:12:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}漫画场地的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当场上的漫画英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.60,0:12:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.44,0:12:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那次破坏无效化
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.89,0:12:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并让攻击力提升500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.24,0:12:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧，国王亚瑟！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:12:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，当国王亚瑟的攻击力发生变化时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}国王亚瑟的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.23,0:13:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.23,0:13:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予相当于提升后攻击力数值的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.91,0:13:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风暴之剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.03,0:13:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样，知道厉害了吧，邪恶的爪牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.51,0:13:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，上了！我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将装备魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.22,0:13:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奇迹之大剑装备给国王亚瑟！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来攻击力提升500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.66,0:13:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力发生变化了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我使用1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.25,0:13:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将变化后的攻击力数值的伤害赐予你！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.42,0:13:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风暴之剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.81,0:13:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！国王骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:13:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.79,0:14:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真遗憾啊。No.众是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.72,0:14:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用 No.众就赢不了的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过呢 这一点也 在故事的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.95,0:14:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}预料之中就是了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.28,0:14:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动奇迹的大剑的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.86,0:14:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了这张卡的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.36,0:14:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中没能将对手怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.87,0:14:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张奇迹的大剑送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.66,0:14:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌发动魔法卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.97,0:14:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了巴利安世界打倒邪恶吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.05,0:14:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.92,0:14:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.15,0:14:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是!?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.93,0:14:38.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙果然还是屏障！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.03,0:14:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用漫画英雄 王者阿瑟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.99,0:14:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量 变化！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.65,0:14:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在正是现身之时！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.38,0:14:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伟大屏障之力的象征！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.92,0:14:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量 漫画英雄 传说阿瑟！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.28,0:15:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙就是屏障的新力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.30,0:15:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量在
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.47,0:15:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用升阶魔法特殊召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.43,0:15:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将对方场上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.87,0:15:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部归为己有。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌抽取！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.26,0:15:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.71,0:15:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每夺取1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.53,0:15:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的怪兽攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.71,0:15:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降300点！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.08,0:15:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗还没结束呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.51,0:15:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用屏障之力召唤的怪兽是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连 No.都能破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.69,0:15:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 传奇弓箭手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.66,0:15:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:41.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌爆裂！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[无线电]鲨鱼 喂 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.67,0:15:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[无线电]游 游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.49,0:15:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.97,0:15:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然那家伙的房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那本素描本就在！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:16:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}里面还夹着漫画的原稿。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.79,0:16:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实 你妹妹作为女主角{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.02,0:16:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被关在牢房里囚禁起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.50,0:16:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.23,0:16:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你找到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.29,0:16:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但都是徒劳的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结局已经无法改变了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.13,0:16:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结局…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.55,0:16:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是悲伤的结局。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.59,0:16:24.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也告诉你们吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.38,0:16:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了救出被囚禁的公主{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.26,0:16:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恶魔的使者 鲨鱼和我这个英雄展开战斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.05,0:16:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于消灭了邪恶。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.94,0:16:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但为时已晚{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.58,0:16:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}公主陷入了永远的沉睡再也醒不过来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.93,0:16:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 你输掉了决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.19,0:16:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的妹妹也救不回来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.65,0:16:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.18,0:16:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会 那……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.12,0:16:56.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道不管做什么都是白费力气吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.90,0:16:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.27,0:16:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.85,0:17:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就凭这种东西 我们的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能让它来决定啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.01,0:17:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼站起来！站起来战斗啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.87,0:17:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 只有你才能保护妹妹啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.51,0:17:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挡在我前面的家伙全部揍飞！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.02,0:17:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才配叫鲨鱼吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.46,0:17:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.65,0:17:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((璃绪：凌牙 凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.53,0:17:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙 决斗绝对要赢哦))
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.01,0:17:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 璃绪。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管等待着的是怎样的未来我都不知道{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.51,0:17:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪我一定守护。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以璃绪 睁开眼吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:46.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.69,0:17:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙 凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.12,0:18:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.47,0:18:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能 为什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.11,0:18:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.65,0:18:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君 这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.38,0:18:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.43,0:18:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他思念妹妹的那份心意{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.82,0:18:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把巴利安的咒缚给打破了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.25,0:18:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.29,0:18:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 你在决斗中输了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.75,0:18:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能你居然会在我面前输掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是谁的错啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.47,0:18:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不承认！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.65,0:18:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然打破我的空想世界我不承认！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.39,0:18:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 传说军刀的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.95,0:18:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当破坏对方怪兽时
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.71,0:18:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.10,0:18:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将因战斗破坏的1只对方怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.56,0:18:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.06,0:19:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其攻击力数值的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.08,0:19:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.67,0:19:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.89,0:19:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真遗憾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 陷阱卡 激流苏生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我早就发动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.55,0:19:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自身场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.59,0:19:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水属性怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.80,0:19:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏时
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.71,0:19:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此时，将被破坏的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.41,0:19:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部特殊召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.29,0:19:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1只那样的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.60,0:19:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给予对手玩家{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.15,0:19:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.78,0:19:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.30,0:19:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将鲨鱼·德雷克
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.05,0:19:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.00,0:19:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.62,0:19:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，CNo.32
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.27,0:19:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海咬龙 鲨鱼·德雷克·拜斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动鲨鱼·德雷克·拜斯的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.40,0:19:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.16,0:19:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地中带有“鲨鱼”之名的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.63,0:19:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:20:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除外的是 鲨鱼·龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.11,0:20:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将鲨鱼·龙攻击力2800
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.64,0:20:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从传说渔人那里夺走。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.02,0:20:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动速攻魔法 怒涛的浸食。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.99,0:20:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡破坏场上1张场地魔法。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.53,0:20:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你这混蛋无聊的场地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就灰飞烟灭了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.93,0:20:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的漫画场地！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.18,0:20:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 这张卡让场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.78,0:20:31.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水属性怪兽攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.11,0:20:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 鲨鱼·龙·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.01,0:20:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击传说渔人！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深渊 混沌 撕咬！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.83,0:20:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.69,0:21:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 你很强啊帅爆了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.83,0:21:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哟 大总统！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.14,0:21:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.26,0:21:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.44,0:21:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代凌牙同学 万岁 万岁！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.32,0:21:13.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 就差一步了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.36,0:21:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的妄想混蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.69,0:21:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.99,0:21:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(有贺)神代凌牙同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.27,0:21:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请看。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我构思了以你为主角的故事。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.40,0:21:45.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～ 好帅！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.95,0:21:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无聊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.10,0:21:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说 我的角色呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.02,0:21:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 啊啊 是这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.16,0:22:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个是真不愧是游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.85,0:22:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的 真的。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.54,0:22:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 我不是主角吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.77,0:23:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.31,0:23:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.75,0:23:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.73,0:23:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.05,0:23:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.88,0:23:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.96,0:24:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.06,0:24:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.07,0:24:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
